    "answer": {
      "short": "$p=5,\\ q=0$",
      "worked": "$$\\binom{4p-6}{-8-3q}=\\binom{14}{-8}$$\nEquating corresponding components:\n$$\\begin{aligned}4p-6&=14\\\\4p&=20\\\\p&=5\\end{aligned}\\qquad\\begin{aligned}-8-3q&=-8\\\\-3q&=0\\\\q&=0\\end{aligned}$$",
